    "expected": {"sessionCount":4,"cacheReadTokens":900,"cacheWriteTokens":100,"ratio":0.9,"undefinedRatioSessionCount":0},
    "note": "Rule 3, withDescendants: read 100 + 800 = 900, write 100 + 0 = 100, 900 / 1000 = 0.9; sessions 1 + 3 = 4."
  },
  {
